#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/simulation.rst:70
msgid "MPS3_AN547 (Arm FVP)"
msgstr "MPS3_AN547 (Arm FVP)"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/simulation.rst:72
msgid ""
"The FVP is Arm's Fixed Virtual Platform for the Corstone SSE-300, shipped as"
" part of `Arm Virtual Hardware <https://www.arm.com/products/development-"
"tools/simulation/virtual-hardware>`__. It is available for **Linux** only --"
" on a Mac, use the QEMU target above instead."
msgstr ""
"FVP는 Corstone SSE-300을 위한 Arm의 Fixed Virtual Platform으로, `Arm Virtual "
"Hardware <https://www.arm.com/products/development-tools/simulation/virtual-"
"hardware>`__ 의 일부로 제공됩니다. 이는 **Linux** 에서만 사용할 수 있습니다 -- Mac에서는 대신 위의 QEMU "
"타깃을 사용하십시오."

